{"seq":3,"slug":"diverse-appraisals","title":"多元的评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"admirers-and-critics","title":"崇拜者与批评者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/admirers-and-critics","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-assessment","title":"历史地位的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment","wordCount":1723,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"多元的评价\">多元的评价</h1><p>对乔布斯的评价从来不是一边倒的。本章呈现围绕他的多元声音，并尝试给出更平衡的历史定位。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;崇拜者与批评者&quot;——两种对立的声音如何各自触及他的某一面真实，共同构成理解他的多元图景。第二篇文档讲述&quot;历史地位的评判&quot;，在超越一时争议的尺度上，审视他作为信息时代塑造者与商业巨匠的历史席位。</p>\n"}